name: Payment fraud starter
tagline: "Synthetic payment attempts, SIM changes and disputes - a card-number scan at ingest, rolling-window features, four payment typologies and a default Risk Score"
description: "A payment fraud content pack (slice 1) over a deterministic synthetic corpus: three Stage-1 Pipelines that scan every row at ingest for a Luhn-valid 13-19 digit number (Unicode digits folded, spaces and punctuation between digits allowed, contained anywhere in one cell) and delete the whole file when one is found - a number split across two cells is not caught; five feature Datasets built by sql.template Jobs over rolling windows (each shipped as a zero-row schema seed the first run replaces), four per-entity Alert Rules (card testing, BIN attack, velocity burst, SIM-swap takeover) and a per-account Risk Score with a default factor table. Thresholds are configuration. Pristine sample files land in data/samples - copy each feed into data/inbox/<feed> to ingest."
icon: heroicons_outline:credit-card
contents[5]: "3 Pipelines + card-number scan", "5 feature Datasets (sql.template)", "4 payment typology Alert Rules", "Risk Score (default factors)", "Synthetic golden corpus"
